<Positioned left="66" top="32"><Text fontSize="12" color="#F5A524FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="1">STRATOSPHERE REVIEW · ISSUE 07 · 2026</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="52"><Text fontSize="34" color="#F5F8FCFF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">The treaty rail</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="91"><Text fontSize="15" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Eight decisions, in the order they were taken</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="116.94"><Text fontSize="12" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">The Protocol is not one agreement but a framework plus adjustments and amendments, each one tightening the controls. The chronology below is the one the scientific assessment itself publishes.</Text></Positioned>
